{"id":2771,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为贯彻落实省教育厅《关于建立大中小学思政课一体化“县校协作”机制通知》，深入推进思政课教学改革创新，强化中华优秀传统文化与“思想道德与法治”课程的融合育人实效，2025年11月4日，中北大学马克思主义学院在17号教学楼104Z教室举办了一场别开生面的思政教学展示与交流活动。中北大学马克思主义学院教学副院长郭玲霞主持活动，阳曲县教育局、尖草坪区教育局、朔州市教育局教师代表以及访学研修教师与学院思想道德与法治基础教学部全体教师共同参会，凝聚育人共识，共话教学提升。此次活动既是学院思政教学成果的一次集中展示，更是校地联动、共促思政教育提质增效的重要探索。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULRNnaM4VfMmf2MSlLPUmWVUNLDn77zYnmQfnzQ2Ul-iolC0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYMYhfLkh2L4LaM8r2M462MRlDLzr7nN-YM4fRnm7DLzrFL7MfL8LsM4nFM8L4LYb/v2veo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLz90MzCZMSbw62l8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/427A0F3307EF77F45615DFB270CF1615/0CA3C774/7C33\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULRNnaM4VfMmf2MSlLPUmWVUNLDn77zYnmQfnzQ2Ul-iolC0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYMYhfLkh2L4LaM8r2M462MRlDLzr7nN-YM4fRnm7DLzrFL7MfL8LsM4nFM8L4LYb/v2veo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLz90MzCZMSbw62l8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\"></p><p>教学展示环节，张艳玲老师以“中华优秀传统文化融入‘德法’课的思考”为题，从内在逻辑、重要途径与主观保障三个维度展开论述。任敏老师聚焦“中国精神的丰富内涵”，系统解读了伟大创造精神、伟大奋斗精神、伟大团结精神与伟大梦想精神的深刻要义。王丽娜老师则以“尊重和弘扬中华民族历史文化”为主题，强调中华优秀传统文化是中华民族的“根”与“魂”，并针对历史虚无主义的错误思潮，提出在思政教学中要强化历史教育，引导学生树立正确的历史观，从民族历史文化中汲取前行力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM4CnYnz-iL778nS7l8LmvbM8lbnzlziUmLYo7L4U4LDozl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkMYyiMkyaM4UaUzVfLRUiMRGPM4N8nmvaU4QkLlW2MmTFo7LYUm-DozWFL8W2MlLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2B7540740A1A045401794F70C6B1BF69/8C2B2692/3BF5C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM4CnYnz-iL778nS7l8LmvbM8lbnzlziUmLYo7L4U4LDozl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkMYyiMkyaM4UaUzVfLRUiMRGPM4N8nmvaU4QkLlW2MmTFo7LYUm-DozWFL8W2MlLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Unm9nbnzWRU4NanSzL4UzWVU8Q2U4UzZnmCPUm7bLRW7UmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyioSyiUSyinRM2nm9sLlWknzNDU4CPLznkUzQ7nmvbLzWFo7UPn7M7MzAFUm-DL1b/v2veo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLz90MzCZMSbw62l8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0595A5D3FF871BBE96C6114BA6DF7912/8D1DCD58/B262\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Unm9nbnzWRU4NanSzL4UzWVU8Q2U4UzZnmCPUm7bLRW7UmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyioSyiUSyinRM2nm9sLlWknzNDU4CPLznkUzQ7nmvbLzWFo7UPn7M7MzAFUm-DL1b/v2veo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLz90MzCZMSbw62l8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UoRTn2Uzn7Mm-snSm-PM7LiMm-aLlLzbLmr7MmCZnNlDnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2okhknkhkLNUiLzTRU8LDMz-bUlQRUzGYozl4Uz9YM8MFM7lanl7PMm6FL4CiUzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F8BDB2D519CCC6529AFCA02953A827C/4E0EA167/365A9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UoRTn2Uzn7Mm-snSm-PM7LiMm-aLlLzbLmr7MmCZnNlDnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2okhknkhkLNUiLzTRU8LDMz-bUlQRUzGYozl4Uz9YM8MFM7lanl7PMm6FL4CiUzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\"></p><p>展示结束后，与会教师围绕“弘扬中华优秀传统文化”展开热烈讨论。大家一致认为，思政课与传统文化融合要避免“碎片化”，应通过“整合—细化—深挖”三步走，打造主题鲜明、内容完整、案例新颖的教学“金点”。案例选取既要“接天线”，也要“接地气”，贴近学生的生活场景与情感体验，才能真正实现入脑入心，让思政课真正“活”起来、“实”起来。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UU47naLlUPLz-YoSznRLmrkLz9snRLzZnmGsnR94MzG8M7l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2LSyiLYyPL77YMmGDUN-aMR6fM49iUmNYoRlYUNLPnz6Fo7VkoRGZU8VFL4CPozvJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F15310A2606BB047A785B92852BC1E7/8AB808CA/36197\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMzLnYLlM2UzWkMS4UaM7rRLzffozrzVnRUDUmQ2Uz74LRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USyiUYy4LYy4ollDL4LiMzffn7r2Uz-DnzGPUzUbU4MkLlMFnlrfLl-aL7WFo77iLz7Jv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.png\"></p><p>活动最后，郭玲霞副院长作总结讲话。她指出，大中小学思政课一体化建设是一项长期系统工程，中北大学马克思主义学院将以此次活动为契机，持续搭建校地思政课教学交流平台，推动优质教学资源共享，不断探索思政课教学创新路径。未来，学院还将常态化组织此类教学交流活动，助力思政课教师队伍专业成长，为培养担当民族复兴大任的时代新人贡献力量。</p><p>会后，全体人员还前往中北大学兵器陈列馆开展现场实践学习。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL77nZMmLYMRrkLSNCDLNlaM7U8MmTz7MmW2MmGYM7LiLlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkMkyPMShRU87DMRA2nmn2Mm7Pn7LsL4WVL8MkMlMkUNVFL4LiM87iL7rFL4VVn77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4B415CCA648FF4F611DC732E3CB5CBBA/3357A50E/31EDA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UL77nZMmLYMRrkLSNCDLNlaM7U8MmTz7MmW2MmGYM7LiLlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkMkyPMShRU87DMRA2nmn2Mm7Pn7LsL4WVL8MkMlMkUNVFL4LiM87iL7rFL4VVn77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4lDoRlJqdlnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次思政教学交流活动的成功举办，不仅实现了校地思政教师的经验碰撞与思想交融，更为中华优秀传统文化融入思政课明确了实践方向，为后续大中小学思政教育一体化推进奠定了坚实基础。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULRNnaM4VfMmf2MSlLPUmWVUNLDn77zYnmQfnzQ2Ul-iolC0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYMYhfLkh2L4LaM8r2M462MRlDLzr7nN-YM4fRnm7DLzrFL7MfL8LsM4nFM8L4LYb/v2veo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLz90MzCZMSbw62l8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=5685&e=.jpg"}